{"id":"yasno","lemma":"ясно","pos":"adv","rank":204,"glosses":["clearly","brightly","finely"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0e/Ru-%D1%8F%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%8F%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это не совсем ясно.","en":"It's not quite clear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283432","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"quite"},null]},{"text":"Я могу видеть ясно сейчас.","en":"I can see clearly now.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to see"},null,{"g":"now"}]},{"text":"Теперь мне всё ясно.","en":"Now it's all clear to me.","words":[{"g":"now, at present"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"everything, all"},null]},{"text":"Я ясно помню тот день.","en":"I remember that day clearly.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to remember","l":"помнить"},{"g":"that one, those ones"},{"g":"day, daytime"}]},{"text":"Ясно, что он дома.","en":"It is clear that he is at home.","words":[null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"at home"}]}]}